<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Source discovery and evidence review</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/atlas/style.css"><style>main{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:24px}article{border:1px solid #777;margin:16px 0;padding:16px}a{color:#f4b36b}input,select,button{padding:10px;font:inherit}*:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #c69ce9}label{display:inline-block;margin:10px}p{line-height:1.6}</style></head><body><main><a href="/admin/collection">Collection status and editions</a> · <a href="/">Public staging view</a><h1>Source discovery and evidence review</h1><p>Persistent collected metadata and saved drafts. A discovery lead is not a verified outbreak, treatment recommendation or substance event. Nothing here is automatically published or plotted.</p><form method="get"><label>Review track<select name="kind"><% ['all','disease','substance','treatment','news'].forEach(k=>{%><option value="<%=k%>" <%=kind===k?'selected':''%>><%=k%></option><%})%></select></label><label>Search<input name="q" value="<%=query%>"></label><button>Filter leads</button></form><p role="status"><%=rows.length%> leads match</p><% rows.forEach(r=>{const a=r.article;%><article><h2><a href="/admin/edit/<%=encodeURIComponent(a.id)%>"><%=a.title%></a></h2><p><%=r.kind%> · <%=r.structured?'Structured evidence saved; approvals still required':'Needs human extraction and evidence classification'%></p><p><%=a.summary||'Original summary not yet written. Imported headline is a research lead.'%></p><p>Source publication: <%=a.provenance?.published_at||a.date_published||'Unknown'%> · Retrieved: <%=a.provenance?.retrieved_at||'Unknown'%> · Event date: <%=a.outbreak?.onset_date||a.drug_event?.event_date||'Unknown'%></p><p>Event area: <%=a.outbreak?.location?.name||a.drug_event?.location?.name||'Not verified; no map pin'%> · Rights: <%=a.rights?.status||'Unreviewed'%></p><p>Specialist review: <%=a.editorial?.specialist_review_requirements||'Classification required; clinical guidance always requires independent clinical review'%></p><a href="<%= /^https:\/\//.test(a.source_url||'')?a.source_url:'#' %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source · <%=a.source%></a></article><%})%></main></body></html>
